== o08_borrowedresult
  san:    exit 0 borrowedresult 1|borrowedresult 12|
  O3:     exit 0 borrowedresult 1|borrowedresult 12|
  interp: exit 0 borrowedresult 1|borrowedresult 12|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/o08_borrowedresult.debug.san
--- run san
borrowedresult 1
borrowedresult 12
--- run O3
borrowedresult 1
borrowedresult 12
--- interpret
borrowedresult 1
borrowedresult 12
